{{quote|There's a bunch of interesting people in the valley. Are you friends with many people? I live in the countryside. Not too many folks out there.}}
'''Martin''' is a teenager from the countryside outside Pelican Town who works at [[JojaMart]]. Generally hopeful, he enjoys his trips to Pelican Town where he gets the chance to see more than the fields and mountains where he's from. In his free time, Martin enjoys reading books at the [[Stardew:Museum|Museum]] library. Martin is polite and positive with customers and co-workers, but doesn't have many friends outside work who aren't online. His only real friend at JojaMart is [[Claire]].

{{TOC|limit=2}}

== Schedule ==
Martin only comes to Pelican Town on '''Tuesdays''' and '''Saturdays''' for work, and '''Sundays''' to visit the library. If JojaMart closes, he will still visit the library. He returns to working on Tuesdays and Saturdays once the movie theater opens.

His schedule changes if the player marries Claire. Martin will take her Friday shift and also work on rainy days while she stays home.

Martin's schedule also changes after Claire's 6 heart event. If the Community Center is restored, he takes Claire's Monday shift so she can attend Community Center Day. Martin will also attend the Flower Dance, Stardew Valley Fair, and Spirit's Eve holidays.

