==Trivia==
If the player has restored the community center but not the Movie Theater, Martin won't appear in town on Tuesdays and Saturdays, making his only weekly appearances on Sundays. Since his birthday is on a Saturday, this means the player cannot gift him if neither JojaMart nor the Movie Theater are open.

